                                "sense_id": "d1b6e737-7b3a-3cf0-a50d-1be574f3d93e",
                                "text": "The Eastern Avon vaunts, and doth upon her take\nTo be the only child of shadeful Savernake [Forest],"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b69fd198-3cd9-47a2-8b69-3187abfe201d",
                                "sense_id": "d1b6e737-7b3a-3cf0-a50d-1be574f3d93e",
                                "text": "Let yourself feel; and shadeful trees,\nRipe corn, and apples red,\nRead as things barren and distasteful\nWhile we are separated!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
